                            "value": "Plants or fungi in the area entangle creatures. The area counts as 3. Each round that a creature starts its turn in the area, it must attempt a Reflex save. On a failure, it takes a -10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until it leaves the area, and on a critical failure, it is also immobilized for 1 round. Creatures can attempt to Escape at entangle's DC to remove these effects."
